      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_SPECULAR has the value 36</p>
  <p>Used to get or set the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PBR_Materials#Nomenclature_changes" target="_blank">Blinn-Phong</a> specular map texture settings of a prim&#39;s <b>face</b>.</p>
</p>
