        <td>a texture in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the <a href="#Target" target="_blank">target</a> prim&amp;#32;or a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a>&amp;#32;of a texture</td>
        <td></td>
